# Environment variables the source reads that no Markdown file documents.
#
# A to-do list, not a permission: a name that is documented by now fails the
# check too, asking to be dropped from here.
#
# Per project, and deliberately not a policy file: "make documentation" copies
# tool_checkenvars.sh from LIBXS and would revert a name removed here.
# Regenerate with: scripts/tool_checkenvars.sh --all
LIBXS_DUMP_BUILD
LIBXS_DUMP_FILE
LIBXS_DUMP_FILES
LIBXS_MALLOC_LIMIT
LIBXS_PREDICT_DECOMPOSE_FOLDS
LIBXS_PREDICT_REFINE
LIBXS_PREDICT_TANGENT
LIBXS_PREDICT_WINDOW_FOLDS
LIBXS_SIGNAL
